description.to:
Implement canonical IR types and the contract-version stamp carried by every expectation and finding.

Fields include:

- stable repo-local gold/finding entity identity appropriate to the layer;
- asserted concept leaf and taxonomy ancestry;
- component type/subtype and optional asserted vendor/instance;
- evidence and derivation locations as arrays;
- observed-token candidate plus provenance;
- display text isolated from matching;
- contract and adapter-map versions.

The type system distinguishes asserted fields from optional descriptive data and distinguishes canonical accepted observations from migration diagnostics. It must be impossible to construct an accepted source-token-only data item or unresolved legacy flow.

Replaces overloaded key strings and the current `EvalCase` / `LayerFinding` pair as scoring currency.
